msgid ""
"The flow sensor should be mounted with the head of the little man facing "
"forward and the camera facing down, as shown in the image above."
msgstr "安装光流传感器时，小人头部应朝前，摄像头朝下，如上图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:34
#: 1af01b26fb2c4b9f887d754d085dc46c 29589620e74d4d449b123a342b66af16
#: 97d2f0bc42144d368832277c79013806 ead5dedabef74829ab29ee561380fc83
msgid ""
"Connect the sensor's GND and TX pin to one of the autopilot's serial ports. "
"Note that the TX pin of the sensor should be connected to the RX pin of the "
"autopilot. In the image above the sensor is connected to a Pixhawk's Telem2 "
"port."
msgstr ""
"将传感器的 GND 和 TX 引脚连接到飞控的某个串口。注意传感器的 TX 引脚应连接到飞控的 RX 引脚。上图中传感器连接到 Pixhawk 的 "
"Telem2 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:35
#: 224760c5ebd7418392c0d2a24ca510ce 3a5f6de71866459ba122d72b768bd5b7
#: 4cb80387e0ac404a878d38cd4b86c26a b529bd998b564710b2bbd19d98b28880
msgid "Connect the sensor's VCC to a 3.3V or 5V power source."
msgstr "将传感器的 VCC 连接到 3.3V 或 5V 电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:36
#: 0da73b724c7a41529c6c87d3496e110e 43a9386048734c7191c794ab9611d6f2
#: 52bb685b958f4d9abab7bb0ed599dc9c 79f7d0ec701440b4806982ccc593137c
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 8"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:37
#: 11221390b03e438bb1777d380deeced7 34d764fafda042af95f169d3a90d4850
#: 3f42afd086144fabb8406a1130e2ec2f 5bc04a5682bd400db6b30a0beaaa8c9f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 18 if using Serial2/Telem2,"
" if connected to another serial port use the corresponding SERIALx_PROTOCOL "
"parameter"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Serial2/Telem2，设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"18；如果连接到其他串口，使用相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:40
#: 2e168d419a5c455fab64eb4df778a154 bf8c9df4a25d466686daa4418e0da344
#: d967196e3c0c4827858fbec9b976b53d ea1ae90f4afe4f9ab80df175f74f2547
msgid "Additional Notes"
msgstr "附加说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:42
#: 522e6eb50f2a4f128ae4968367dc40eb 60487c6f7cc64276a5ced195b0dc5cdc
#: 6c4e62b70c1d4d809a3a0df2aeb13194 a560f2244457481d919b0aa9f61ea425
msgid ""
"As with the :ref:`PX4Flow sensor <common-px4flow-overview>` a range finder "
"is required to use the sensor for autonomous modes including :ref:`Loiter "
"<loiter-mode>` and :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`PX4Flow 传感器 <common-px4flow-overview>` 一样，在 Loiter 和 RTL "
"等自主模式中使用该传感器需要配备测距仪（:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:43
#: 1919019508f94ebc898948e0cc08d2c7 65636b3820234bf9a890ae9b94ed5c4f
#: 683c64e7c3f64af8b287f34d90898009 aa8f66b381a84097b85982cf10cb429a
msgid ""
":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` does not require the use of a rangefinder"
msgstr ":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` 模式无需使用测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:44
#: 1e3449e48ce2493fa5c0a49e3b2903ad 2f222de16f514717b9c933c317939373
#: 3a065264f1f04158a6cce25479abb581 f0cbc944363c45ffa131dc454c753dad
msgid ""
"Performance can be improved by setting the :ref:`sensors position parameters"
" <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`.  For example if the sensor is mounted"
" 2cm forward and 5cm below the frame's center of rotation set "
":ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` to 0.02 and :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` to"
" 0.05."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`传感器位置参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` "
"可以提升性能。例如，若传感器安装在机架旋转中心前方 2cm、下方 5cm 处，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` 设为 "
"0.02，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` 设为 0.05。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-upflow.rst:47
#: 0138846f634d44dab3a946cd5301dc4e 06f305b9cbee4095ab3600ba481d5674
#: 27666ad54453478db55a4588dc9c49c8 f1d716fa3af24f8dbf82f11902b802c2
